From d918f1e3f9d3dfa6b4230c168427041edf16bc4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GianFadiga <gianluccafadigarissato@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:01:10 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Turn indicators: choose Off / Automatic / On (manual) /
 Automatic + manual in the menu

MISC.TurnIndicators becomes a choice (0 and 1 keep their meaning) and applies live. The new
Automatic + manual mode keeps the automatic steering-based blinkers while no blinker or hazard was
switched on by hand; a manual blinker takes priority until the player switches it off.
TURNINDICATORS.ManualTurnIndicators = 1 keeps its old meaning (Automatic behaves as On (manual)).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J2EEBdczaXVKRDjePb6ox8
